## Changed

- Made sampling-lane claim and completion transitions atomic with `Ref.modify`, preserving one active sample and one coalesced follow-up.
- Fixed daemon retry scheduling: non-blocking snapshot reset polling now permits the Schedule to execute 1/2/4/8/8-second retries.
- Moved attempt retry ownership to a scoped queue-backed stream worker; interruption finalizes active attempts and suppresses late callbacks.
- Added deterministic coverage for retry/reset timing, retry-wait and active-attempt interruption, blocked initial sampling, config defaults/tagged validation, and post-hello connection shutdown.

